# Agent memory system — gitignore
# This file is part of the bootstrap package. Merge with your project's
# existing .gitignore if one already exists.

# Per-machine agent notes — never commit. Holds host-specific paths,
# ssh aliases, local container names, etc. Secrets should NEVER live
# here either — reference them ("token in .env").
docs/agent/LOCAL.md

# Optional Codex local config that shouldn't be committed (if you choose
# to keep machine-specific Codex config out of git):
# .codex/auth.json
# .codex/config.local.toml

# Optional Claude local settings:
# .claude/settings.local.json
